  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "28512001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "柔嘉",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28512002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "柔嘉",
          "text": "您……您来了……早上好……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28512004",
              "text": "已经不是早上了哦？"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "28512004",
              "text": "柔嘉看起来好像很不安阿。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28512003",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28512004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "柔嘉",
          "text": "对不起……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28512006",
              "text": "为什么要一直道歉呢？"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "28512006",
              "text": "柔嘉又没做错什么。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28512005",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28512006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "柔嘉",
          "text": "我……是这样吗……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28512008",
              "text": "能跟我说说为什么吗？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28512007",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28512008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "柔嘉",
          "text": "柔嘉总是……带来不幸……\n只要把自己关起来，就不会伤害到别人了吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28512010",
              "text": "根本不是这样。"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "28512010",
              "text": "才没有谁会带来不幸。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28512009",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28512010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "柔嘉",
          "text": "您是……认真的吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28512011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "嗯，柔嘉一直都是善良又温柔的女孩子。\n认识柔嘉，我觉得很幸运。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28512012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "柔嘉",
          "text": "听到您这样说……谢……谢谢您。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
